{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Main Plane&quot;</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this game, you play as a girl who has lost her memories, and embark on a journey to explore a bizarre world. Witness the construction of a colossal tower, unravel your origins, and discover the fate of both the tower and this world.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game features a &quot;seed-based&quot; skill combo system. Through the combination of Skill Seeds, you can craft unique skills, designing your own combos to suit your playstyle.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628910/extras/86a087b5e29854d8dfaa780086d9e585.avif?t=1756432305\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628910/extras_big/86a087b5e29854d8dfaa780086d9e585.avif?t=1756432305 width=800 height=450 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can freely explore many unique stages. Journey through diverse environments, encounter exotic creatures, and discover new Skill Seeds to help you face ever more powerful enemies.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628910/extras/eb6f62cdf01e6317ede312d67fda36f3.avif?t=1756432305\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628910/extras_big/eb6f62cdf01e6317ede312d67fda36f3.avif?t=1756432305 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A deep skill customisation system that lest you create unique combos.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adorable, figure-like characters.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautifully detailed stages with various themes and atmospheres.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A wide variety of enemies and bosses.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A thrilling single-player story filled with twists and dramatic moments.</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3628910?t=1756432305","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3628910?t=1756432305","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628910/806cc2b7f0984eee467ed8347ec7dcfd772092bc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756432305","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628910/806cc2b7f0984eee467ed8347ec7dcfd772092bc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756432305","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Main Plane&quot;</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this game, you play as a girl who has lost her memories, and embark on a journey to explore a bizarre world. Witness the construction of a colossal tower, unravel your origins, and discover the fate of both the tower and this world.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game features a &quot;seed-based&quot; skill combo system. Through the combination of Skill Seeds, you can craft unique skills, designing your own combos to suit your playstyle.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com